Replay the fixed initial portion through acquisition to identify its
initial 13 prefix to skip. No variable outer input precedes activation;
at a target during activation both later variable prefixes are empty.
Replay of the requested endpoint still stops at its own n, without
requesting future input. Merge later reservoirs by the installed
